{"id": "e-1788627075007-owjvih", "lake": "A-18", "field": "trip_reports", "value": "Sep 2026: Ryan and I took his new truck up the Norway flats Road and parked where 035 branches off to 916, which took 45 minutes. I think his truck would’ve easily made it to where 035 branches 035A. But it was actually a blast ride mountain bikes to the trailhead (15 minutes). We each caught 3 brookies, and surprisingly zero tigers given the stocking record for the last 10 years. Battling the wind in my pack raft wasn’t much fun.", "ts": "2026-09-05T16:51:15.007Z", "device": "dev-7wvw8frc", "applied_at": "2026-09-05T16:53:04+00:00"}
